warm-up rallies to fierce topspin duels.\n- **Online multiplayer** \u2014 create a room, invite friends, and chat with built-in voice while you play.\n- **Ranked play** \u2014 climb the global ladder with Elo matchmaking and leaderboards.\n\n**Real table tennis feel**\nAuthentic ball physics with topspin and backspin, tuned for satisfying rallies on Quest.\n\n**Make it yours**\n- Unlockable paddle and ball skins\n- Multiple courts, from cozy rooms to floating stadiums\n- AR passthrough mode that puts a table in your real living room\n- Full English and Chinese support\n\nA match takes about 5 minutes \u2014 perfect for a quick break.\n\n**Join our Discord community** \u2014 meet players, find opponents and get the latest news: https://discord.gg/kuU6Kkukc\n\nSee you at the table!", "short_description": "Fast, friendly VR table tennis. Challenge a smart AI or rally online with friends around the world \u2014 a quick match takes just 5 minutes. Realistic ball physics, voice chat, ranked ladders and playful courts make every rally feel alive. Free to play, easy to pick up, hard to put down."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://chunjunliang.github.io/pingpangBattle/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Chunjun Liang", "support_website_url": "https://chunjunliang.github.io/pingpangBattle/support.html", "website_url": "https://chunjunliang.github.io/pingpangBattle/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "su